msgid "Use the unlocked strip at the edge of the farmland. Stand beside an untilled tile and face it. Select the hoe, then use it. Previously prepared unlocked soil also counts."
msgstr "Use the unlocked strip at the edge of the farmland. Stand beside an untilled tile and face it. Select the hoe, then use it. Previously prepared unlocked soil also counts."

msgid "Move a seed into one of the first six bag slots if needed, then select that slot. Stand beside dry, prepared, empty farmland and use the seed. Only a successful planting after this step unlocks counts."
msgstr "Move a seed into one of the first six bag slots if needed, then select that slot. Stand beside dry, prepared, empty farmland and use the seed. Only a successful planting after this step unlocks counts."

msgid "Select the watering can and use it on dry soil containing your crop. Plain soil and rain do not count as manually watering a crop. Rewater when soil dries out."
msgstr "Select the watering can and use it on dry soil containing your crop. Plain soil and rain do not count as manually watering a crop. Rewater when soil dries out."

msgid "Keep the planted tile watered and wait for the plant to mature. Interact with the mature crop. If the bag cannot hold the full harvest, sell some produce first; the crop remains in place."
msgstr "Keep the planted tile watered and wait for the plant to mature. Interact with the mature crop. If the bag cannot hold the full harvest, sell some produce first; the crop remains in place."

msgid "The produce buyer stands beside the supply merchant near the market stalls. Approach, face the buyer and interact. Select produce and a quantity, then sell. Supply purchases and order deliveries do not count as this sale."
msgstr "The produce buyer stands beside the supply merchant near the market stalls. Approach, face the buyer and interact. Select produce and a quantity, then sell. Supply purchases and order deliveries do not count as this sale."

msgid "The supply merchant sells young animals for available pen space. Existing living animals also count. Open Objectives to claim this reward when it is ready."
msgstr "The supply merchant sells young animals for available pen space. Existing living animals also count. Open Objectives to claim this reward when it is ready."

msgid "Buy feed from the supply merchant if needed. Select feed, stand beside a food trough and interact. Feed is consumed only when the refill lands. A full trough does not count."
msgstr "Buy feed from the supply merchant if needed. Select feed, stand beside a food trough and interact. Feed is consumed only when the refill lands. A full trough does not count."

msgid "Select the watering can, stand beside a water trough and interact. A successful refill counts; a full trough does not. The watering can is not consumed."
msgstr "Select the watering can, stand beside a water trough and interact. A successful refill counts; a full trough does not. The watering can is not consumed."

msgid "Find the sign at the next locked farmland column. Approach and interact to see the price, then confirm if you can afford it. Existing ownership of two columns also counts."
msgstr "Find the sign at the next locked farmland column. Approach and interact to see the price, then confirm if you can afford it. Existing ownership of two columns also counts."

