msgid "Move with the left joystick or tap the ground. Tap a hotbar slot to select it, then tap Use. Face a target and tap Interact, or tap the target itself. Pinch with two fingers to zoom. Swipe lists and help text to scroll. Play in landscape."
msgstr "Move with the left joystick or tap the ground. Tap a hotbar slot to select it, then tap Use. Face a target and tap Interact, or tap the target itself. Pinch with two fingers to zoom. Swipe lists and help text to scroll. Play in landscape."

msgid "Move with WASD, arrow keys or a left click on the ground. Select slots 1–6 with number keys or the mouse. Use the selected item with Space or right click. Interact with E or click a target. Open Bag with Tab or I, Objectives with J, and Help with H. Scroll lists with the wheel."
msgstr "Move with WASD, arrow keys or a left click on the ground. Select slots 1–6 with number keys or the mouse. Use the selected item with Space or right click. Interact with E or click a target. Open Bag with Tab or I, Objectives with J, and Help with H. Scroll lists with the wheel."

msgid "Open Bag to inspect all 64 slots. Only the first six slots appear on the hotbar. Tools are reusable; seeds and feed are consumed. Sell harvested crops, flowers or animal produce to the produce buyer. Buy seeds and feed from the supply merchant. Selling produce for coins is separate from delivering orders."
msgstr "Open Bag to inspect all 64 slots. Only the first six slots appear on the hotbar. Tools are reusable; seeds and feed are consumed. Sell harvested crops, flowers or animal produce to the produce buyer. Buy seeds and feed from the supply merchant. Selling produce for coins is separate from delivering orders."

msgid "In Bag, select a slot, tap Move, then tap its destination. Move a seed or tool into the first six slots to use it."
msgstr "In Bag, select a slot, tap Move, then tap its destination. Move a seed or tool into the first six slots to use it."

msgid "Drag items between bag slots to swap or stack them. Move a seed or tool into the first six slots to use it."
msgstr "Drag items between bag slots to swap or stack them. Move a seed or tool into the first six slots to use it."

msgid "Growth uses real elapsed time, including time away from the game. An unwatered flower does not start growing; crops need moist soil. Animal hunger, thirst, age and lifespan also advance offline. Keep food and water in troughs. Inspect animals to see needs and production; young or hungry animals may not produce. Opening a menu does not pause the farm. The game autosaves; let the save notice finish before leaving. Long absences can leave animals hungry, thirsty or past their lifespan."
msgstr "Growth uses real elapsed time, including time away from the game. An unwatered flower does not start growing; crops need moist soil. Animal hunger, thirst, age and lifespan also advance offline. Keep food and water in troughs. Inspect animals to see needs and production; young or hungry animals may not produce. Opening a menu does not pause the farm. The game autosaves; let the save notice finish before leaving. Long absences can leave animals hungry, thirsty or past their lifespan."

msgid "The order board is left of the market stalls. It holds up to three requests. Bring all requested items, select an order and confirm delivery for coins. Abandoning also asks for confirmation and has no coin penalty. There are no deadlines. Sell all at the produce buyer can sell items requested by orders, so deliver those first if you want to keep them."
msgstr "The order board is left of the market stalls. It holds up to three requests. Bring all requested items, select an order and confirm delivery for coins. Abandoning also asks for confirmation and has no coin penalty. There are no deadlines. Sell all at the produce buyer can sell items requested by orders, so deliver those first if you want to keep them."

msgid "If your bag is full, sell produce or stack matching items. If seeds run out, water and harvest existing crops, collect animal produce or flowers, then sell them and buy seeds. Check your pens and the supply merchant. If you have no seeds, no produce in your bag, no field crops and too few coins for seeds, you may request one carrot seed here once per profile. This does not reset the farm or give coins. Hints can be disabled or skipped without completing objectives or receiving their rewards."
msgstr "If your bag is full, sell produce or stack matching items. If seeds run out, water and harvest existing crops, collect animal produce or flowers, then sell them and buy seeds. Check your pens and the supply merchant. If you have no seeds, no produce in your bag, no field crops and too few coins for seeds, you may request one carrot seed here once per profile. This does not reset the farm or give coins. Hints can be disabled or skipped without completing objectives or receiving their rewards."

